{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟", "occurrences": 9, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "異", "id": "異"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.6094379124341003, "source": "愛", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.8622008809294686, "source": "愛", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.8622008809294686, "source": "取", "target": "水"}, {"weight": 2.3513752571634776, "source": "取", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.157452788691043, "source": "君", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 0.8697707162392622, "source": "君", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.157452788691043, "source": "君", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.3397743454849977, "source": "君", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.3397743454849977, "source": "君", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.494476100804151, "source": "君子", "target": "存"}, {"weight": 1.6835458845878224, "source": "君子", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.3958638121360414, "source": "君子", "target": "異"}, {"weight": 0.990398704027877, "source": "君子", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.1727202608218317, "source": "君子", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 0.22314355131420976, "source": "存", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.2676659890376327, "source": "存", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.5745188084776873, "source": "存", "target": "異"}, {"weight": 2.169053700369523, "source": "存", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.8813716279177422, "source": 